@startuml
participant Host
participant ObservationValidator
participant ExactClone
participant PredecessorValidators
Host -> ObservationValidator: --all(candidate revision)
ObservationValidator -> ExactClone: clone and detach exact candidate
ObservationValidator -> PredecessorValidators: each --all in ExactClone
PredecessorValidators -> PredecessorValidators: original gates + finite extension admission
PredecessorValidators --> ObservationValidator: complete retained evidence
ObservationValidator --> Host: pass/fail exact candidate
@enduml
